    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Fit a mediated causal model in systems with predator, intermediate consumer, pollinator and plant abundance time series, testing whether predator changes propagate through the specified links to plant frequency. A significant signed indirect effect supports the chain.";
